# BAWAAL onboarding stack (LOCKED — V1 full-stack)

Authoritative summary: `.cursor/rules/bawaal-v1-fullstack-locked.mdc`.

The **landing / onboarding / Email+Password / legal / location-flag / profiles** flow is **production-final**. Do **not** modify, restyle, reorder, or rewire unless the user explicitly unlocks this rule.

**Auth unlock (2026-11-23):** SMS Phone+OTP replaced by **Email ID + Phone Number + Create Password** with **Sign In** and **Forgot Password**.

